  "translation": "Na Elyakim, pikinini bilong Hilkiahu, na Shevna, na Yoak, i tokim Rav Shake: Plis, tokim ol wokman bilong yu long tok Aram, bilong wanem mipela i save harim; na no ken tok wantaim mipela long tok Yuda, long ol aun bilong ol manmeri we i stap long banis.",
